# Belt and braces.
#
# The repository root .gitignore already excludes everything in this directory
# except the documentation. This second file repeats the rule locally so that
# the protection survives someone editing the root file, moving this directory
# into another project, or running `git add` from inside here.
#
# If you are about to add an exception: do not add one for a DTU Health Tech
# tool. Those are licensed to you personally and may not be redistributed.
# See DTU_TOOLS.md.
*
!.gitignore
!README.md
!DTU_TOOLS.md
